sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Jupyter Notebook)
    participant SDK as CodeFlare SDK<br/>(Python Client)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant CFOp as CodeFlare Operator
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant Kueue as Kueue Controller
    participant RayHead as Ray Head Pod<br/>8265/TCP Dashboard
    participant RayWorker as Ray Worker Pods

    Note over User,RayWorker: Flow 1: Cluster Creation via AppWrapper

    User->>SDK: Cluster(ClusterConfiguration(...))
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET /apis/kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1/localqueues<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Default LocalQueue name
    SDK->>SDK: Generate RayCluster YAML from template<br/>Apply CPU/Memory/GPU config
    SDK->>SDK: Wrap RayCluster in AppWrapper YAML<br/>Add kueue.x-k8s.io/queue-name label
    SDK->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/workload.codeflare.dev/v1beta2/appwrappers<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: AppWrapper created
    CFOp->>K8sAPI: Watch AppWrapper CR
    CFOp->>Kueue: Submit workload for scheduling
    Kueue-->>CFOp: Workload admitted
    CFOp->>K8sAPI: Create RayCluster CR
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Watch RayCluster CR
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Create Head Pod + Worker Pods
    K8sAPI-->>RayHead: Pod scheduled
    K8sAPI-->>RayWorker: Pods scheduled

    Note over User,RayWorker: Flow 2: Ray Job Submission

    User->>SDK: RayJobClient(cluster)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET /apis/route.openshift.io/v1/routes<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: Ray dashboard Route URL
    SDK->>RayHead: POST /api/jobs/<br/>8265/TCP via Route (HTTPS)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    RayHead-->>SDK: Job ID
    loop Poll job status
        SDK->>RayHead: GET /api/jobs/{id}<br/>8265/TCP via Route (HTTPS)
        RayHead-->>SDK: Job status (PENDING/RUNNING/SUCCEEDED/FAILED)
    end
    SDK->>RayHead: GET /api/jobs/{id}/logs<br/>8265/TCP via Route (HTTPS)
    RayHead-->>SDK: Job logs
    SDK-->>User: Job results + logs

    Note over User,RayWorker: Flow 3: TLS Certificate Generation for Ray Client

    User->>SDK: generate_cert(cluster_name, namespace)
    SDK->>K8sAPI: GET /api/v1/secrets/{cluster}-ca-secret-{suffix}<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>SDK: CA cert + key (ca.crt, ca.key)
    SDK->>SDK: Generate RSA-2048 client key<br/>Create X.509 cert signed by cluster CA<br/>SHA256 signing, SAN: localhost, 127.0.0.1
    SDK->>SDK: Write certs to tls-{name}-{ns}/ directory<br/>Set RAY_TLS_* environment variables
    User->>RayHead: ray:// connect<br/>10001/TCP via Route (gRPC/TLS)<br/>Auth: mTLS client certificate
    RayHead-->>User: Interactive Ray session
